Subject: [RFC PATCH -tip v5 03/27] kprobes/x86: Remove jprobe implementation
Date: Tue,  5 Jun 2018 00:49:57 +0900
Message-Id: <152812739780.10068.9232752880126886142.stgit@devbox>
